{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1309576-2e-hungry-underworld-\u2013-is-there-more-ghosts-than-living","id":1309576,"title":"[2E] Hungry Underworld \u2013 Is there more ghosts than living?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-02T22:26:50-07:00","id":1309576,"title":"[2E] Hungry Underworld \u2013 Is there more ghosts than living?","content":"I just <i>dreamed</i> this topic into being. We know that in 2E, Underworld is 'hungry'. It literally devours ghosts over millenia. Question is simple - How quick is Underworld in this process? Are in it ghosts from thousands years before? Is there more ghosts than total population of whole Earth on the same time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-03T12:33:55-07:00","id":1309727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1309576-2e-hungry-underworld-\u2013-is-there-more-ghosts-than-living#post1309576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just <i>dreamed</i> this topic into being. We know that in 2E, Underworld is 'hungry'. It literally devours ghosts over millenia. Question is simple - How quick is Underworld in this process? Are in it ghosts from thousands years before? Is there more ghosts than total population of whole Earth on the same time?</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, the answer by and large depends on what sort of game you want to play, BUT<br /> <br /> <i>Probably?</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-09T14:32:35-07:00","id":1311058,"title":"","content":"The question at the heart of this is: what does the essence economy of the underworld look like? The underworld traps ghosts in the walls when they can no longer spend essence to stave it off; the other dangers like the ocean of fragments are more avoidable. So deciding how much Essence flows into the underworld and how various specters manage that resource will determine how many and how quickly ghosts get consumed.<br /> <br /> The way I imagine this, from my reading of the mechanics, is that ghosts in the underworld mostly get essence from being remembered by the living and from consuming Castoffs on the banks of the rivers. How many Castoffs are formed is highly subjective, as people have to miss the object when it\u2019s destroyed, but since they usually don\u2019t have anchors, most would get dragged Below pretty immediately. I estimate a Castoff might have 1 essence per Size for ghosts to scavenge.<br /> <br /> Keeping these mechanics in mind helps (me at least) imagine the geography and society of the underworld (at least in the upper reaches) full of scavenging and predation. Small, stable river towns seem pretty likely, depending on population density, but a single ghost on their own could easily be consumed within weeks.<br /> <br /> <br /> If I was better at math and programming, I would design something to help visualize the essence economy, just for my own reference... I\u2019ve wanted something like that for ghosts and spirits for a while now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-09T15:36:29-07:00","id":1311076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seraph Kitty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1309576-2e-hungry-underworld-\u2013-is-there-more-ghosts-than-living?p=1311058#post1311058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I was better at math and programming, I would design something to help visualize the essence economy, just for my own reference... I\u2019ve wanted something like that for ghosts and spirits for a while now.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lotka%E2%80%93Volterra_equations\" target=\"_blank\">These are the equations you want, have fun.</a><br /> <br /> [edit]Just throwing the equations at you is kind of mean, if you have any questions on how to model, let me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 05-09-2019, 06:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}